# Culvert Ambusher (Disguise {4}{G}) cast face down on turn 1 ({3} from Black Lotus) is a 2/2 with no abilities, so entering triggers
# nothing (CR 708.2: the stack is empty after it resolves). Turned face up on turn 5 it triggers once (CR 702.168d, 708.8) and Bot1 targets Bot2's
# Llanowar Elves, which must block this turn if able (CR 509.1c): Bot2 may not decline to block (refused with `! Bot2.Block(Count: 0)`),
# and the 4/5 Culvert Ambusher kills it. The disguise cost (CR 702.168d, 116.2b) is refused with four sources (a count short) and with five
# sources and no green (a color short: Island plus four Moxen), then paid exactly from Mox Emerald and four others: the pool is empty
# right after, so no more than {4}{G} was taken.

